    <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 15px;">You must accept in writing that you are willing to receive copies of notices of cancellation, non-renewal and conditional renewal from Unum. Should you desire to terminate the status as a third party designee, you shall provide written notice to both Unum and the policyholder.</p>

